source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A tab separates a marker from its item exactly as a space does, so jiro reads the same list it reads from `* item`.
-- input.jira --
*	item
-- rendered.html --
<ul>
	<li>item</li>
</ul>
-- want.md --
- item
-- warnings.json --
[]
